cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "SIA: running big language models on a 6 GB laptop without losing intelligence"
abstract: >-
  Measured study of running large mixture-of-experts language models (Gemma 4 26B-A4B,
  gpt-oss-20b) with llama.cpp on an RTX 3050 6 GB laptop with 16 GB of RAM, using only
  released-precision models and output-preserving speed-ups, with controlled benchmarks and
  paired accuracy tests; packaged as Sia, an offline desktop AI app.
type: software
authors:
